OL,3,GNEWSADevelopers consulting on plans for
OL,4,Aup to 1,750 homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FHousing developers have launched a
OL,7,Fconsultation on plans to build up to
OL,8,F1,750 homes on land north of Market
OL,9,FHarborough.
OL,11,FHallam Land and William Davis Homes are
OL,12,Fconsulting on proposals to build a
OL,13,Fhousing development on land east of
OL,14,FHarborough Road and south of Gallow
OL,15,FField Road, next to Airfield Business
OL,16,FPark.
OL,18,FThe Local Democracy Reporting Service
OL,19,F(LDRS) said developers had detailed
OL,20,Fplans for a three-form entry primary
OL,21,Fschool, as well as including proposals
OL,22,Ffor land for a secondary school.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
