OL,3,GNEWSADevelopers consulting on plans for
OL,4,Aup to 1,750 homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the consultation website,
OL,7,Fthe developers are intending to submit
OL,8,Foutline planning applications to
OL,9,FHarborough District Council this
OL,10,Fwinter.
